# Changing this file on a push runs the Wikidata workflow: what Wikidata holds about the place.
# Kenilworth, Warwickshire: the box of its 9 November 2026 snapshot, into its own folder, as the
# build takes the newest file in a folder. (Croydon's: BBOX=-0.091572,51.368900,-0.056992,51.390483.)
SNAPSHOT_NAME=kenilworth
BBOX=-1.625,52.322,-1.540,52.368
WIKIDATA_OUT=data/wikidata/kenilworth
